I stand at the empty court.
A young woman and two men come over to me.
The woman smiles.
"Hello, I am Lena," she says.
She points to the two men.
"These are Timo and Max."
I also say hello.
"I am Maya," I answer.
Lena sees my racket.
"Do you want to play with us?" she asks.
"We want to play a doubles match."
"But we are only three people."
"Can you play along now?"
I am very happy.
"Yes, gladly!" I say.
"I gladly play with you."
Max smiles in a friendly way.
"Super, then we can start immediately," he says.
We go onto the court together.
